    "If the **same player wins all 3 boards** of a round, they get a Full Board bonus on top of the per-board payouts." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Full Board bonus feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si **le même joueur remporte les 3 boards** d'une manche, il touche un bonus Full Board en plus des gains par board."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If two or more players tie at the top of a board, they go to a split. In the manual counter, just tick the multiple players who tied. A new selection grid appears below to pick the final winner among them." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the split rule, explaining how it works and what the UI should look like.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si deux joueurs ou plus sont à égalité en tête d'un board, ils vont au split. Dans le compteur manuel, coche simplement les joueurs à égalité. Une nouvelle grille apparaît dessous pour choisir le gagnant final parmi eux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a manual counter, the app highlights a Full Board banner once you've selected the same winner on the 3 boards, so you can double-check before validating." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to use the app to check for a Full Board bonus.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans un compteur manuel, l'app affiche un bandeau Full Board dès que tu as choisi le même gagnant sur les 3 boards, pour vérifier avant de valider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In short: 3 burns total, 5 cards per board, 3 boards. The 3 boards are played independently." : {
      "comment" : "A brief explanation of how the three boards are played independently.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
